-- Expand thin CMS landing pages with useful, accurate portfolio copy.
-- Updates only published rows whose descriptions are missing or too short.
UPDATE services
SET description = CASE slug
  WHEN 'website-development' THEN 'Website development turns a business goal into a clear, usable website. I build frontend experiences for business websites, landing pages and personal portfolios, with attention to page structure, responsive layouts, navigation, accessibility and maintainable code. The work starts with understanding the audience and the action each page should support, then shaping the content and interface around that goal. Backend systems, databases and complex integrations are scoped separately where required.'
  WHEN 'responsive-web-design' THEN 'Responsive web design helps a website remain usable across phones, tablets, laptops and desktop screens. I plan flexible layouts, readable typography, practical spacing, touch-friendly controls and image behaviour so visitors can navigate without unnecessary zooming or horizontal scrolling. I also consider content hierarchy and accessibility, because a layout should remain understandable as well as visually consistent on different devices.'
  WHEN 'css-animations-interactive-ui' THEN 'Interactive interface design uses purposeful motion and feedback to make digital products easier to understand. I create CSS transitions, hover and focus states, responsive navigation details and lightweight interface interactions that support the user journey rather than distract from it. Motion is kept considerate of performance and reduced-motion preferences, with clear visual states for interactive elements.'
  WHEN 'digital-content-production' THEN 'Digital content production supports the way a business communicates across its online channels. Work can include branded graphics, promotional visuals, short-form video edits, captions and platform-ready creative assets. Each piece is planned around the intended audience, message, format and publishing channel so the content remains consistent with the brand and has a clear communication purpose.'
  WHEN 'website-deployment' THEN 'Website deployment prepares a completed website for public use. This service covers production build checks, hosting configuration, domain and DNS coordination, environment settings, HTTPS verification and a practical launch review. The goal is a reliable handover with the key pages and forms checked after release. Hosting plans, domain purchases and third-party service charges remain separate from the implementation work.'
  WHEN 'basic-seo-performance' THEN 'SEO and performance foundations help search engines discover pages and help visitors reach useful content quickly. The work can include descriptive page titles, useful meta descriptions, canonical URLs, crawlable internal links, XML sitemaps, robots directives, image alternative text and structured data where appropriate. I also review page weight and loading behaviour, while treating indexing and ranking as outcomes that depend on search engines and ongoing content quality.'
  ELSE COALESCE(NULLIF(description, ''), summary, title) || char(10) || char(10) || 'This service is planned around the client''s goals, intended audience and required deliverables. The scope is agreed before work begins, with attention to usability, responsive presentation, accessibility and a clear handover.'
END,
updated_at = NOW()
WHERE is_published = TRUE AND (description IS NULL OR LENGTH(TRIM(description)) < 180);

UPDATE projects
SET description = CASE slug
  WHEN 'restaurant' THEN 'This portfolio concept explores a restaurant website experience that helps visitors understand the food offering, discover useful information and decide how to get in touch. The presentation focuses on a clear visual identity, readable menu-led content, straightforward navigation and prominent next steps. The project is included as a design and frontend showcase for the restaurant and hospitality category, with attention to mobile usability and a consistent experience across screen sizes.'
  WHEN 'agency' THEN 'This portfolio concept presents a digital agency landing page designed to communicate services and establish a clear first impression. The page structure gives space to the agency proposition, service information and contact actions, using a deliberate content hierarchy to guide visitors through the offer. It demonstrates how a focused landing page can organise brand messaging and make the next step easy to find on desktop and mobile.'
  WHEN 'blog' THEN 'This portfolio concept presents a technology blog homepage for organising editorial content and helping readers discover articles. The layout focuses on readable headlines, clear content groupings, simple navigation and a structure that can support ongoing publishing. It demonstrates frontend page composition for an editorial website, including the importance of scannable content and a consistent reading experience across devices.'
  WHEN 'shop' THEN 'This portfolio concept explores a fashion e-commerce storefront where visitors can browse product categories, review product information and move toward a purchase action. The interface uses product-focused presentation and clear shopping controls to keep browsing understandable. It is a frontend portfolio showcase for retail and fashion businesses, with emphasis on product discovery, visual hierarchy and responsive layouts.'
  WHEN 'event' THEN 'This portfolio concept presents a digital wedding invitation page for sharing event information with invited guests. The experience is centred on the event identity, essential details and a simple page structure that works when opened from a phone or computer. It demonstrates how a focused event page can communicate key information clearly without making visitors navigate a complex website.'
  WHEN 'calculator' THEN 'This portfolio concept demonstrates a multi-tool calculator interface designed to make common calculations accessible from one place. The page structure prioritises clear inputs, understandable labels and visible results so users can complete a task without unnecessary steps. It is included as a frontend interaction and usability showcase, with attention to responsive presentation and straightforward controls.'
  WHEN 'medpulse' THEN 'MedPulse is presented in this portfolio as a medical learning and community platform project. Its stated scope includes learning resources, user profiles, posts, discussions, messaging, verification and moderation workflows. The project explores how learning and community features can be organised within one digital product. The repository link provides the available technical reference; this page describes the project scope rather than making claims about clinical use or institutional endorsement.'
  WHEN 'church-media-broadcast-system' THEN 'The Church Media Broadcast System is a project focused on the digital workflows involved in church media and broadcasting. Its stated scope covers live media workflows, streaming infrastructure, administration and service operations. The project considers the operational side of coordinating media activity, with a repository link available for technical review. This portfolio entry describes the intended system scope and does not claim a particular live deployment or audience size.'
  WHEN 'softly-digital-cbt' THEN 'Softly Digital CBT is a computer-based testing application project. Its stated scope includes candidate and centre workflows, examination management and an Appwrite-backed application structure. The project explores how an online assessment experience can organise the different tasks involved in preparing and delivering an examination. The repository link is provided as the technical reference; specific production usage or examination outcomes are not claimed here.'
  WHEN 'socialpulse-v10' THEN 'SocialPulse is a social video platform project covering video feeds, user profiles, follows, comments, messaging, notifications and moderation tools. The project explores the interface and feature organisation required for a community product built around video content and user interaction. Its listed technology context includes Vue 3, Appwrite and JavaScript. This entry describes the project scope and available implementation reference rather than claiming production scale.'
  WHEN 'xoft-ai-assistant' THEN 'XOFT is a personal AI assistant project exploring provider-agnostic model routing, tool orchestration, memory, voice interfaces, integrations and a command-centre interface. The project is intended to bring conversational assistance and practical task execution into one workflow. Its scope continues to evolve, so this portfolio description focuses on the architecture and capabilities being developed rather than claiming that every planned feature is complete.'
  ELSE COALESCE(NULLIF(description, ''), summary, title) || char(10) || char(10) || 'This portfolio entry describes the project at a high level and provides a starting point for reviewing its purpose, interface and implementation choices. The available project or repository link should be used for further technical detail.'
END,
updated_at = NOW()
WHERE is_published = TRUE AND (description IS NULL OR LENGTH(TRIM(description)) < 180);
